<view class="page-followup-result">
  <view class="container">
    <view class="card fures-head">
      <view class="fures-check">✓</view>
      <view class="fures-title">复诊申请已提交</view>
      <view class="text-muted fures-sub">可在下方查看本次申请的内容</view>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{detail}}" class="card">
      <view class="fures-row">
        <text class="fures-label">就诊人</text>
        <text class="fures-value">{{detail.patientName}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="fures-row">
        <text class="fures-label">复诊科室</text>
        <text class="fures-value">{{detail.departmentName}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="fures-row">
        <text class="fures-label">复诊医生</text>
        <text class="fures-value">{{detail.doctorName}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="fures-row">
        <text class="fures-label">疾病信息</text>
        <text class="fures-value">{{detail.disease}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="fures-row">
        <text class="fures-label">当前状态</text>
        <text class="fures-status fures-status-{{detail.statusTone}}">{{detail.statusLabel}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="fures-row">
        <text class="fures-label">申请时间</text>
        <text class="fures-value">{{detail.timeText}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <button class="btn-primary fures-detail-btn" bindtap="onGoDetail">查看复诊详情</button>
    <button class="btn-outline fures-home-btn" bindtap="onBackHome">返回首页</button>

    <view class="text-muted fures-note">
      首版为复诊申请流程演示，不涉及实际开药；用药请遵医嘱。
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
